+- **Parallel agents in one worktree.** They overwrite each other and the diff becomes archaeology. Assign each concurrent writer an exclusive physical worktree and an absolute path in its brief.
 - **Using `/arena` for coverage.** `/arena` repeats one design or code brief, then picks a base and grafts the best parts. `/swarm` partitions slices or declared race arms and aggregates one report.
